      "text": {
        "jp": "敵には弱点となる属性があり、その属性で攻撃することで\r\n大ダメージを与えることができます。\r\n\r\n弱点属性は、最初は「？」で表示されますが\r\n属性攻撃を当てると判明していきます。\r\n\r\n弱点を見つけるため、様々な攻撃を試してみましょう。",
        "official_en": "Enemies have elemental weaknesses, and attacks\r\nwith these elements will deal increased damage.\r\n\r\nAn enemy’s weakness will be hidden until it is struck\r\nby the correct elemental attack.\r\n\r\nVary your attacks and uncover your foes’ weaknesses.",
        "real_en": "Enemies have elemental weaknesses. Attacking with the right element deals increased damage.\r\n\r\nAt first, weak elements are shown as “?”, but hitting an enemy with an elemental attack gradually reveals its weaknesses.\r\n\r\nTry different attacks to discover what your foes are weak to."
      },
